    "Ответ обрезан по лимиту длины.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The answer was cut off at the length limit."
          }
        },
        "uz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Javob uzunlik cheklovi sababli kesildi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ответ продолжила модель %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The answer was continued by model %@."
          }
        },
        "uz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Javobni %@ modeli davom ettirdi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ответы": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers"
          }
        },
        "uz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Javoblar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Отвечает на всё, что слышит. Для тихого места, где вы один.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers everything it hears. For a quiet place where you’re alone."
          }
        },
        "uz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eshitgan hamma narsasiga javob beradi. Yolgʻiz oʻzingiz boʻlgan sokin joy uchun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Отвечает, когда фраза обращена к нему, и молчит, когда вы говорите с другими. Имя не обязательно.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers when a phrase is meant for it and stays quiet when you’re talking to others. The name isn’t required."
          }
        },
        "uz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gap oʻziga qaratilganda javob beradi, boshqalar bilan gaplashayotganingizda esa jim turadi. Ismini aytish shart emas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Отвечает, только если фраза начинается с имени.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers only if the phrase starts with its name."
          }
        },
        "uz": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gap ismi bilan boshlangandagina javob beradi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Отвечать сразу": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answer right away"
